          %h2#references References
          %h3#polarization_of_dbranes Polarization of D-branes
          %p Precursor discussion appears in
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Roberto+Emparan"}> Roberto Emparan
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %em Born-Infeld Strings Tunneling to D-branes
              = succeed ")" do
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/9711106"} arXiv:hep-th/9711106
          %p
            The effect now known as the “Myers effect” in
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/D-brane"} D-brane
            theory was first described in:
          %ul
            %li#Myers99
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Robert+Myers"}> Robert Myers
