          %h3#polarization_of_m2branes_into_m5branes Polarization of M2-branes into M5-branes
          %p
            The Myers effect in
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/M-theory"} M-theory
            for
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/M2-branes"} M2-branes
            polarizing into
